// Conformance fixture for ta.rma (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.19, Wave 5B-1).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's RMA (Wilder smoothing)
// formula against a hard-coded synthetic close series (see ta_rma.csv
// `close` column). Equivalent to EMA with α = 1/length; used inside RSI's
// average-gain/loss channel per Wilder's original 1978 formulation.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_rma", overlay=true)
plot(ta.rma(close, 3), title="rma3")
